original:
I've added a latency indicator in my game HUD, and it's displaying an average ping of 120ms, but I'm not sure how to improve this - can someone review my code and suggest optimizations? 
```javascript
class LatencyIndicator {
  constructor() {
    this.pingTimes = [];
  }

  addPingTime(time) {
    this.pingTimes.push(time);
    if (this.pingTimes.length > 10) {
      this.pingTimes.shift();
    }
  }

  getAveragePing() {
    return this.pingTimes.reduce((a, b) => a + b, 0) / this.pingTimes.length;
  }
}

const latencyIndicator = new LatencyIndicator();
// ...
```

